  "id": "acquaintance-rape",
  "term": "acquaintance rape",
  "definition": "Acquaintance rape is rape or sexual assault in which the victim and perpetrator are acquainted, rather than strangers. In psychology and social research, it is often discussed separately from stranger rape, especially in studies of victim blaming.",
